    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00877",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "只有梦见难以相信之梦的时候，才会希望得到刺青、徽章、勋章。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Only when one dreams an unbelievable dream does one long for tattoos, badges, or medals.",
